+  can be reused later in a genuinely original rebuild without appearing in
+  this game. Compatibility data is retained only to prevent older v5.1-v5.3
+  saves that already contain a custom Pokémon from crashing.
+
+> For a completely canonical roster, start a **new v5.4 save**. An older save
+> may still physically contain a previously caught custom Pokémon; v5.4 will
+> load it safely, but provides no way to obtain another one.
+
+### PokeMan Journey v5.3 — Danyip family
+
+- Added **Danyip → Danny → Danimal**, a pure Normal-type Field Egg Group
+  family at National Dex numbers **#402–404**. Danyip evolves at level 16 and
+  Danny at level 32; the line has its full requested stats, growth, friendship,
+  level-up moves, teachables, Pokédex entries, footprints, cries, menu icons,
+  front/back battle art, follower art, and charcoal/chocolate shiny palette.
