+  Toxic Spikes, failed and allied attempts, double-battle source selection,
+  Own Tempo, Substitute, and repeat activation after curing. Existing
+  Synchronize tests remain part of the full battle suite.
+- The ROM now identifies itself as **v5.3**. The opening screen says
+  **PokeMan Journey by xecho3x** instead of presenting the upstream Pokémon
+  World creator as the creator of this edition; upstream attribution remains
